"North-Indian D1 chart. Loads in a frame: there is no page-side template for "
"it yet."
msgstr ""
"Diagramme D1 de l'Inde du Nord. Chargement dans un cadre : il n'existe pas "
"encore de modèle de page pour celui-ci."

#: includes/views/admin-shortcodes.php:202
msgid "Transit Sky"
msgstr "Transit Sky"

#: includes/views/admin-shortcodes.php:203
